@startuml job-class-team-growth
!include _standard-style.puml
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam componentFontSize 15
skinparam arrowFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide stereotype
title A team grows its taxonomy

component "**any member**\ncoding job-classes propose\nthe teacher reads the prompts\nno class could place" as proposer <<cli>>
component "**proposals/<team>/<member>-<time>.json**\nin the member's OWN repo\ntest + synthetic examples, no prompts" as prop <<storage>>
component "**maintainer**\ncoding job-classes fold\nthe teacher labels each proposal's\nexamples under today's classes" as maint <<core>>
component "**absorb**\nmost land in one class:\nit already holds the job" as absorb <<core>>
component "**add**\nunder the cap:\na new class" as add <<core>>
component "**merge to make room**\nat the cap: the two classes the\nteacher confuses most become one;\nthe other is retired (tombstone)" as merge <<core>>
component "**stability check**\nreference prompts under old and new;\nkappa < 0.7 on untouched classes = refused" as stab <<core>>
component "**new version**\ntaxonomy.yaml + CHANGELOG.md\n+ folded.json, committed;\nmembers pull it" as ver <<storage>>

proposer -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]right-> prop : writes
prop -[#FF9800,thickness=2]right-> maint : pulled with\ntheir repo
maint -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> absorb
maint -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> add
maint -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> merge
add -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> stab
merge -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> stab
stab -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]left-> ver : passes
absorb -[#757575,thickness=1,dotted]down-> ver : recorded only

legend right
  an old label of a retired class
  counts for the class it merged into
endlegend
@enduml
